---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadForm from '@/components/LeadForm.astro';
import TestimonialsSection from '@/components/TestimonialsSection.astro';
import karinPortrait from '@/assets/karin/karin-portrait.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Karin Wulff"
  description="Karin Wulff is a Realtor® at Nexus Realty in Arden, NC. Five years in Asheville after growing up in NJ and selling real estate in the Catskills. AVL Curious is her working guide to the area for buyers."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px] lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sun-600">About</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl text-mountain-900 sm:text-5xl">
          Hello, meet Karin.
        </h1>
        <div class="prose mt-6 max-w-none text-lg text-mountain-700">
          <p>With a successful career in sales and a passion for real estate, becoming a Realtor was the obvious move for Karin. In every transaction, her first priority is her client’s happiness. She is a good listener with a focused commitment to clear communication and follow through, always striving to ensure that the buying or selling process is fun, easy, and stress-free.</p>
          <p>When she’s not landscaping or involved in a DIY project on her home, she can be found hiking the beautiful mountains of Asheville where she resides.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="lg:pt-16">
        <Image
          src={karinPortrait}
          alt="Karin Wulff, Realtor at Nexus Realty"
          width={720}
          height={900}
          loading="eager"
          class="rounded-lg shadow-md"
        />
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-mountain-400">Photo: Carol Spags Photography</p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <hr class="my-12 border-mountain-100" />

    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-mountain-900">A few details</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-mountain-700">
      <li><strong>Brokerage:</strong> Nexus Realty, 100 Julian Shoals Drive, Arden, NC 28704</li>
      <li><strong>Areas:</strong> Buncombe, Henderson, Madison, Haywood — Asheville, Black Mountain, Weaverville, Hendersonville, Brevard, Lake Lure, and the smaller corners between them.</li>
      <li><strong>Direct:</strong> <a href="tel:+12017256428">(201) 725-6428</a></li>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:karin@fuzzywolfsales.com">karin@fuzzywolfsales.com</a></li>
    </ul>

  </article>

  <TestimonialsSection background="white" />

  <section class="bg-cream">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <LeadForm source="about-bottom" heading="Want to talk?" blurb="Drop a note. I'll come back within a day, and we'll figure out if working together makes sense." />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
